# Camera/render masters. Every one of these has a cut under public/videos/ that
# the site actually loads, so the masters stay local — they are only kept around
# in case a cut has to be re-made. The web cuts under public/videos/ are the ones
# in the repo, via Git LFS (see .gitattributes).
#
# 604MB, exceeds GitHub's 100MB limit. Cut: public/videos/revolt-96sec.mp4.
src/assets/images/REVOLT 96SEC.mp4
# 165MB, exceeds GitHub's 100MB limit. Cut: public/videos/rvx-3d.mp4.
src/assets/images/RVX 3D_Product_Video.mp4
# 64MB. Cut: public/videos/rv-blazex.mp4.
src/assets/images/RV_BlazeX.mp4
